# AI Movie Recommendation System

An AI-powered movie recommendation platform built as a semester project. The system is split into two independent repositories: a PERN (PostgreSQL, Express, React, Node.js) web application and a Python/FastAPI machine learning microservice that serves personalized movie recommendations.

